1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,150
Closing dari iklan TikTok?

2
00:00:02,150 --> 00:00:03,631
Kirim balik ke TikTok!

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,990
Konektor mengirim closing lewat server,
jadi iklan belajar dari pembeli.

4
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:15,653
Di TikTok Ads Manager, buka Tools,
lalu Events Manager.

5
00:00:15,653 --> 00:00:17,030
Pilih pixel kamu.

6
00:00:17,850 --> 00:00:22,842
Masuk Settings, cari Events API,
klik Generate Access Token.

7
00:00:22,842 --> 00:00:26,170
Salin, karena TikTok tidak menyimpannya.

8
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:32,801
Di Konektor, buka Tracking Website, klik
Tambah platform iklan, pilih TikTok.

9
00:00:33,650 --> 00:00:38,582
Isi nama, tempel Pixel Code dan
Access Token, lalu Simpan.

10
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:43,585
Salin template link iklan, tempel di
kolom URL iklan TikTok.

11
00:00:43,585 --> 00:00:46,585
Jadi nama campaign dan iklan
ikut tercatat.

12
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:48,221
Lead closing?

13
00:00:48,221 --> 00:00:51,570
Langsung terkirim ke TikTok
sebagai Complete Payment!

14
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:55,512
Event dilewati?

15
00:00:55,512 --> 00:00:57,787
Data pencocokannya kurang.

16
00:00:57,787 --> 00:01:03,300
Pasang kode tracking di landing page,
supaya ttclid tertangkap.

17
00:01:04,700 --> 00:01:06,528
Closing balik ke TikTok.

18
00:01:06,528 --> 00:01:08,814
Panduannya di konektor dot id.
